(YIELD DEVIATION INVESTIGATION ? API MANUFACTURING) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Deviation Reference: DEV-2026-127) Tj T*
(Title: Crystallization yield below specification for Ibuprofen API) Tj T*
(Product: Ibuprofen API) Tj T*
(Batch: IBU-26-0033) Tj T*
(Manufacturing Stage: Crystallization and centrifugal filtration) Tj T*
(Equipment or Area: Crystallizer CR-12 and centrifuge CF-07) Tj T*
(Incident Date: 2026-10-08) Tj T*
(Reported By: Tomasz Nowak \(Production Supervisor\)) Tj T*
(Severity Suggested: Major) Tj T*
(Detected By: yield calculation during batch record review) Tj T*
(Quantity Affected: 1 batch \(980 kg theoretical\)) Tj T*
(Immediate Containment: Batch IBU-26-0033 placed on QA hold; no release until) Tj T*
(the deviation is closed.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. SUMMARY) Tj T*
(The isolated yield of batch IBU-26-0033 after centrifugal filtration and drying) Tj T*
(was 87.2 % against the registered yield range of 93.0 % - 97.0 % \(specification) Tj T*
(SPEC-IBU-011\). The deviation was raised during batch record review before) Tj T*
(release.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. PROCESS AND RECORD REVIEW) Tj T*
(The batch manufacturing record shows the heptane anti-solvent was charged in) Tj T*
(20 minutes on 2026-10-08 between 14:05 and 14:25, against the SOP-PR-022 charge) Tj T*
(time of 90 minutes. The crystal slurry was transferred to centrifuge CF-07 at) Tj T*
(15:10. Mother liquor discharge volume recorded in the batch record was 1,240 L) Tj T*
(against a typical 980 L. No in-process control result was out of specification;) Tj T*
(the finished API met all quality attributes except yield.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. DCS TREND REVIEW) Tj T*
(The DCS trend for CF-07 on 2026-10-08 shows the centrifuge basket speed at) Tj T*
(1,850 rpm during the whole filtration cycle, above the recipe setpoint of) Tj T*
(1,200 rpm, and a wet cake thickness signal dropping sharply at 15:32. The) Tj T*
(filtration cycle ended 11 minutes earlier than the typical cycle time.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. MAINTENANCE RECORDS) Tj T*
(Maintenance work order WO-26-4531 reports that the filter cloth on CF-07 was) Tj T*
(found torn during post-batch inspection on 2026-10-08 at 17:50. The cloth was) Tj T*
(replaced the same day. The preventive maintenance record shows the CF-07 cloth) Tj T*
(inspection is scheduled monthly; the last recorded inspection was 2026-08-29.) Tj T*
(Spare cloth lot CLO-26-19 is recorded in the spare parts issue log.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. PERSONNEL) Tj T*
(Operator interview \(2026-10-09, signed\): "we increased the basket speed to keep) Tj T*
(the cycle time because the slurry was very fine; I did not check the recipe) Tj T*
ET
